hing, they saved United Harvest from significant losses.",0,""],["ctl","avg1_110","c","007","exclamation",null,null,null,null,"lengzhan","Linear",1.0],["say","avg1_110","Nyx? What are you doing here?",0,""],["ctl","avg1_138","b","007","flurry",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0],["say","avg1_138","Ah, is the Director of Operations ... ordering me to answer?",0,""],["ctl","avg1_110","c","011","speechless",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0],["say","avg1_110","...",0,""],["ctl","avg1_110","c",null,null,0.25,null,null,null,null,"OutQuint",1.0],["ctl","avg1_138","b",null,null,0.75,null,null,null,null,"OutQuint",1.0],["show","avg2_985","a","003",null,null,1.1,0,null,0.0],["ctl","avg2_985","a",null,"attention",null,null,1.0,1.0,null,"OutQuint",1.0],["say","avg2_985","Nyx, Firenze. Play nice.",0,""],["ctl","avg1_110","c","010",null,null,null,null,null,"JuGong","Linear",1.0],["say","avg1_110","Apologies. I forgot myself.",0,""],["stg",0,null,null,1.1,"OutCubic",1.0,null,null,null],["cbg",0,null,null,0.95,"OutCubic",1.0,null,null,null],["ctl","avg1_110","c",null,null,0.23,null,null,0.0,null,"OutQuint",1.0],["hide","avg1_110",1.0],["ctl","avg1_138","b",null,null,0.77,null,null,0.0,null,"OutQuint",1.0],["hide","avg1_138",1.0],["ctl","avg2_985","a","005",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0],["se","se_062"],["say","avg2_985","And you, Boss. May I call you that?",0,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"x","003",null,"JuGong"],["say","avg3_100","Greetings. I'm the Boss of Boss Accord. The commission is done, though I must apologize for the damage the greenhouse sustained.",1,""],["mrt",3,"x",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg2_985","a","003",null,null,null,null,null,"niunie1","Linear",1.0],["say","avg2_985","Necessary losses. It's late, I know, but I'm intrigued by what happened in there. Care to join me in my office?",0,""],["w",0.5],["trn",0,0,false,false,1],["w",2],["clear",1,0,1],["stg",0,0.0,0.0,1.0,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["bg","dulcia_office_inside_night",0,0.0],["w",1],["trn",1,0,false,false,1.0],["head","00:45, Messis Month 05th, Gold District in Philae, Executive Office"],["se","se_167"],["film",0],["say","0","On the walk over, Darcia talks plenty about United Harvest and the Tawny Nightingale.",3,""],["w",0.5],["say","0","By the time we reach her office, I have just one question left.",3,""],["show","avg2_985","a","003",null,null,null,0,null,0.0],["w",0.5],["film",1],["ctl","avg2_985","a",null,null,null,null,null,1.0,null,"OutQuint",1.0],["se","se_062"],["say","avg2_985","Have a sit. Tea?",0,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"x","011","happy",null],["say","avg3_100","Thanks. About my team...",1,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg2_985","a","005",null,null,null,null,null,"JuGong","Linear",1.0],["say","avg2_985","Relax, they're in good hands. Now, where were we? Ah, yes. The Gen-2 Intelligent Plants in the greenhouse. That's what you're after, isn't it?",0,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"w","020","speechless",null],["say","avg3_100","She's surprisingly upfront. Talked a lot on the way here, even promised to clean up the branch... Maybe she's actually reasonable.",2,""],["mrt",0,"x","002",null,"diantou"],["say","avg3_100","Right. What's United Harvest's actual plan for those plants? Heavy labor in hazardous environments?",1,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg2_985","a","008","happy",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0],["say","avg2_985","In a sense, you're right. They are destined for heavy, dangerous work.",0,""],["stg",0,null,null,1.2,"OutCubic",1.0,null,null,null],["ctl","avg2_985","a","003",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0],["se","se_226"],["say","avg2_985","These plants are the army your servant has prepared for Your Majesty.",0,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"x","011","happy",null],["say","avg3_100","An army,==W== huh...==W== Wait.==W== What? A-Army?",1,""],["bgm",""],["w",1.0],["goon"],["w",1],["mrt",0,"x","025","exclamation","lengzhan"],["goon"],["w",0.5],["goon"],["mrt",3,"x",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg2_985","a","005",null,null,null,null,nul